## Product Overview
PitchPerfect is a web-based AI-powered pitch practice platform. Users rehearse sales presentations against simulated AI customer personas and receive real-time coaching metrics and post-session feedback scores. The MVP validates whether AI practice measurably improves pitch delivery.

Core flow: Setup Page → Practice Session → Feedback Summary (3 screens, linear)

## Non-Negotiable Principles
1. ZERO FRICTION: No signup, no login, no credit card. User starts practicing within 30 seconds.
2. CONVERSATION FIRST: The AI conversation must feel natural. If this does not work, nothing else matters.
3. SHIP COMPLETE: One polished flow beats ten half-built features.
4. INSTRUMENT EVERYTHING: Every session produces data for analytics.
5. DESIGN FOR THE SWITCH: Abstract the AI provider. OpenAI Realtime today, PersonaPlex tomorrow.

## Technology Stack
- **Framework:** Next.js 14+ (App Router) with TypeScript (strict mode)
- **UI:** React 18 functional components + Tailwind CSS 3.4+ + shadcn/ui
- **State:** Zustand 4.x (one store per domain: session-store, audio-store, transcript-store)
- **Conversation AI:** OpenAI Realtime API (gpt-4o-realtime-preview-2024-12-17) via WebSocket relay
- **Feedback AI:** Claude Sonnet (claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929) for post-session transcript analysis
- **Storage:** Vercel KV (Redis) with TTLs. NO PostgreSQL. NO persistent database.
- **Analytics:** PostHog (only initialized after GDPR consent)
- **Hosting:** Vercel (frontend + API routes + KV + analytics)
- **Audio:** Web Audio API + MediaRecorder (16kHz mono, echo cancellation, noise suppression)
- **Icons:** Lucide React

